.TH SDL_ISCOLORSPACE_LIMITED_RANGE 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_ISCOLORSPACE_LIMITED_RANGE \- A macro to determine if an
.BR SDL_Colorspace
has a limited range.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_pixels.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_ISCOLORSPACE_LIMITED_RANGE(cspace)       (SDL_COLORSPACERANGE(cspace) != SDL_COLOR_RANGE_FULL)
.fi
.SH MACRO PARAMETERS
.TP
.I cspace
an
.BR SDL_Colorspace
to check\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns true if limited range, false otherwise\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this macro from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This macro is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

